{"resource":{"id":"go-cheat-sheet","title":"Go \u2014 Cheat Sheet","category":"Programming","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"5 min","pages":2,"lastUpdated":"October 2026","tags":["Programming","Go","Concurrency"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A printable two-page Go cheat sheet \u2014 syntax, keywords, common functions, concurrency primitives, and interview reminders on one reference."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"s1","label":"1. Syntax"},{"id":"s2","label":"2. Keywords"},{"id":"s3","label":"3. Operators"},{"id":"s4","label":"4. Data Types"},{"id":"s5","label":"5. Structs"},{"id":"s6","label":"6. Interfaces"},{"id":"s7","label":"7. Goroutines"},{"id":"s8","label":"8. Channels"},{"id":"s9","label":"9. Common Functions"},{"id":"s10","label":"10. Error Handling"},{"id":"s11","label":"11. Quick Reference"},{"id":"review","label":"Cheat Sheet Review"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"glossary","label":"Glossary"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Go \u2014 Quick Revision Notes","tag":"Programming","time":"6 min"},{"title":"Go \u2014 PDF Notes","tag":"Programming","time":"52 min"},{"title":"Go \u2014 Complete Tutorial","tag":"Programming","time":"55 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Keep a single-page Go reference at your desk.</li>\n          <li>Recognise every keyword, operator, and primitive.</li>\n          <li>Recall concurrency patterns instantly.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Syntax</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>package main\nimport &quot;fmt&quot;\n\nfunc main() { fmt.Println(&quot;hi&quot;) }</code></pre></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517694712202-14dd9538aa97?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 \u2014 Go syntax overview: every program is a package with a main function.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Keywords</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><code>break case chan const continue default defer else fallthrough for func go goto if import interface map package range return select struct switch type var</code></p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Operators</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Arithmetic <code>+ - * / %</code> \u00b7 Comparison <code>== != &lt; &gt; &lt;= &gt;=</code> \u00b7 Logical <code>&amp;&amp; || !</code> \u00b7 Bitwise <code>&amp; | ^ &lt;&lt; &gt;&gt;</code>.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Data Types</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr class=\"border-b\"><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Type</th><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Example</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">int / int64</td><td class=\"p-2\"><code>42</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">float64</td><td class=\"p-2\"><code>3.14</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">string</td><td class=\"p-2\"><code>\"go\"</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"p-2\">bool</td><td class=\"p-2\"><code>true</code></td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Structs</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>type Point struct{ X, Y int }\np := Point{1, 2}</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Interfaces</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>type Stringer interface { String() string }</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Goroutines</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>go func() { fmt.Println(&quot;hi&quot;) }()</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Channels</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>c := make(chan int, 4)\nc &lt;- 1\nv := &lt;-c\nclose(c)</code></pre></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544197150-b99a580bb7a8?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 \u2014 Channel workflow: producers send, consumers receive, close signals done.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s9\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Common Functions</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p><code>len(s)</code> \u00b7 <code>cap(s)</code> \u00b7 <code>append(s, x)</code> \u00b7 <code>copy(dst, src)</code> \u00b7 <code>make(T, n)</code> \u00b7 <code>new(T)</code> \u00b7 <code>delete(m, k)</code> \u00b7 <code>panic(v)</code> \u00b7 <code>recover()</code>.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s10\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Error Handling</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>if err != nil {\n  return fmt.Errorf(&quot;op: %w&quot;, err)\n}\ndefer f.Close()</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s11\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">11. Quick Reference</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr class=\"border-b\"><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Need</th><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Reach for</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">Web server</td><td class=\"p-2\"><code>net/http</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">JSON</td><td class=\"p-2\"><code>encoding/json</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">SQL</td><td class=\"p-2\"><code>database/sql</code> + driver</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">Testing</td><td class=\"p-2\"><code>testing</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"p-2\">Cancellation</td><td class=\"p-2\"><code>context.Context</code></td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"review\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Cheat Sheet Review</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Printable Summary</h3>\n        <p>Two-page format: syntax + keywords on page 1, concurrency + reference table on page 2.</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Daily Reference</h3>\n        <p>Pin near your monitor; glance during code reviews.</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Interview Facts</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Slice header = ptr, len, cap.</li>\n          <li>Nil map read is fine; nil map write panics.</li>\n          <li>Closing an already-closed channel panics.</li>\n          <li>Receiving from a nil channel blocks forever.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Is this enough to learn Go?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">No \u2014 it's a reference. Combine with the Beginner Guide or Complete Tutorial.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Can I print it?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Use the Print button in the toolbar; the layout is print-optimised.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"glossary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Glossary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Defer</strong> \u2014 schedule a call to run when the function returns.</li>\n          <li><strong>Select</strong> \u2014 wait on multiple channel operations at once.</li>\n          <li><strong>Panic / recover</strong> \u2014 Go's last-resort error escape hatch.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n          Cheat sheet for quick reference \u2014 verify details against go.dev before shipping production\n          code. Trademarks belong to their respective owners.\n        </p>\n      </div></section>"}